OL,3,GNEWSACharity 10km run continues man's
OL,4,Alegacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual memorial run is set to take
OL,7,Fplace in Jersey on Sunday to raise
OL,8,Fmoney for a hospice.
OL,10,FThe Hospice 10K organised by Jersey
OL,11,FHospice Care carries on the legacy of
OL,12,Fpolice officer Jayson Lee who died
OL,13,Fwhile playing football in 2009.
OL,15,FThe hospice took over the baton of
OL,16,Frunning the event in 2025 under a new
OL,17,Fname after it was previously called the
OL,18,FJayson Lee 10k Memorial Run for 16
OL,19,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
