OL,3,GNEWSACharity 10km run continues man's
OL,4,Alegacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe route sets off at 09:00 BST at FB
OL,7,FFields in St Clement, and goes along
OL,8,Fall of Jayson's favourite places across
OL,9,Fthe island.
